Add a hindsight_define_topic_page MCP tool, so an agent can create a standing knowledge page on a
topic that is not one initiative (design principles, how a platform fits together) and reword its
question later. Like hindsight_capture_initiative, the agent states only the question and the
server synthesizes the page. Topic pages live in a Topics folder, and only pages in that folder
can be redefined, so the tool can't touch seeded pages, initiatives, or hand-made pages.
